  item (b) would add to it.

An "affiliate" of a party is any person or organization that controls the
party, is controlled by it, or is under common control with it. "Control"
means owning more than half of the voting rights, or having the power to
direct the management, by any means, alone or jointly with others who act
together, directly or through other persons or agreements.

The "staff" of a party means its employees, officers, contractors and
volunteers, its moderators and curators, and anyone who holds
