  1) that a party listed under (a) or (e) of the definition of "Excluded
  Party", or an affiliate of such a party, owns, operates, controls or runs;

  2) that anyone runs on behalf of such a party, at its request or under an
  agreement with it;

  3) that offers, lists, downloads, installs, updates, uploads, syncs, backs
  up or shares mods through, or sends mods to, a mod catalog, an API, user
